  "description": "**Available November 4th****Fully furnished**Sherry FitzGerald Lettings presents this lovely two bedroom (doubles), one bathroom ground floor apartment, extending to approx. 54sqm located in the sought after area of Ballsbridge. Accommodation in brief consists of an entrance hallway, an open style kitchen and a living/dining room. The kitchen is fully fitted with a fridge/freezer, 4 ring hob, oven, microwave, washing machine and dryer. Both bedrooms are equipped with fitted wardrobes and the master bedroom has access to the outdoor patio. Bathroom fitted with a stand up bath shower. Viewing is a must**Professionally Managed by Sherry Fitzgerald Lettings**",
